post_install() {
  cat <<'NOTICE'
x810-device-support installed. It does not enable or start services during
package installation. The image profile explicitly enables the validated
thermal limiter, GNOME device controls, power-profile API, charge-limit restore,
Bluetooth address provisioner, and delayed X810 SSC sensor initialization.
Android's vendor, firmware, DSP, and persist partitions are mounted read-only;
only the tablet-local APNHLOS firmware is staged into the Arch root filesystem.
NOTICE
  if command -v systemd-sysusers >/dev/null 2>&1; then
    systemd-sysusers /usr/lib/sysusers.d/hexagonrpcd.conf || return 1
  fi
}

post_upgrade() {
  :
}
